{"format":"sylvinia-studio-ca","version":1,"module":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest","file":"chronique-alternative/source/src/bellirith-naiah-cross-quest.ts","hash":"df4d8087681c4747","label":"Bellirith × Naïah · croisée quête","group":"Bellirith × Naïah","scenes":[{"key":"§BN_TITLES","title":"","section":"BN_TITLES","used":true},{"key":"§BN_OBJECTIVES","title":"","section":"BN_OBJECTIVES","used":true},{"key":"§BN_MINIGAME_OBJECTIVE","title":"","section":"BN_MINIGAME_OBJECTIVE","used":true},{"key":"act1","title":"Acte I terminé","section":"bnUnlockChecks","used":true},{"key":"naiah","title":"Relation Naïah à l’étape 5","section":"bnUnlockChecks","used":true},{"key":"bellirith","title":"Fil de Bellirith résolu (étape 5)","section":"bnUnlockChecks","used":true},{"key":"met","title":"Naïah et Bellirith rencontrées","section":"bnUnlockChecks","used":true},{"key":"§BN_INTIMACY_EFFECTS","title":"","section":"BN_INTIMACY_EFFECTS","used":true},{"key":"§bnSimulationDoorScene","title":"","section":"bnSimulationDoorScene","used":true},{"key":"cross-bn-05-door","title":"Même là ?","section":"bnSimulationDoorScene","used":true}],"items":[{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s0e988vc","k":"s","text":"Tu simules","sc":0,"line":18},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s0r2b9lv","k":"s","text":"Les Trois Réponses","sc":0,"line":18},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s0kbihrn","k":"s","text":"Jusqu’où ?","sc":0,"line":18},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s1k3o8h1","k":"s","text":"Même là ?","sc":0,"line":18},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s04d9htl","k":"s","text":"Quelque chose d’autre","sc":0,"line":18},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s165vppi","k":"s","text":"Bellirith vous attend à l’Auberge du Forestier. Quelque chose chez Naïah lui échappe, et elle veut un témoin.","sc":1,"line":27},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s0mrefp1","k":"s","text":"Un billet plié en forme d’oiseau vous appelle aux Ruines noyées de brume. Naïah prépare une réception.","sc":1,"line":28},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s1704h5w","k":"s","text":"Bellirith a fait dresser une table de jeu dans la Salle des Élus. Rejoignez-les pour une partie des Trois Réponses.","sc":1,"line":29},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s14rtft8","k":"s","text":"Bellirith et Naïah se sont donné rendez-vous à la Halte du Fleuve bleu. Bellirith a changé de question.","sc":1,"line":30},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s0r1mj36","k":"s","text":"Naïah vous attend dans les appartements de Bellirith, au palais d’Al’Gratal. Elle annonce un pari.","sc":1,"line":31},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s1wdu1k0","k":"s","text":"Bellirith vous a donné rendez-vous à la Clairière des Échos, en plein jour. Elle a quelque chose à vérifier.","sc":1,"line":32},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s1fmrnud","k":"s","text":"Naïah réclame une revanche dans sa clairière. Rejoignez-les à la nuit tombée.","sc":1,"line":33},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s02axntn","k":"s","text":"La partie des Trois Réponses attend sa conclusion. Reprenez-la exactement là où vous l’avez laissée.","sc":2,"line":35},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s0y68s05","k":"s","text":"Acte I terminé","sc":3,"line":78,"role":"label"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s08m2r13","k":"s","text":"Relation Naïah à l’étape 5","sc":4,"line":79,"role":"label"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s0g4wcrp","k":"s","text":"Fil de Bellirith résolu (étape 5)","sc":5,"line":80,"role":"label"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s1df19y8","k":"s","text":"Naïah et Bellirith rencontrées","sc":6,"line":81,"role":"label"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:n0cf5hxn","k":"n","text":"1","sc":7,"line":244,"role":"effet affection"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:n0cp53mm","k":"n","text":"2","sc":7,"line":244,"role":"effet affection"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:n0cf5hxn.1","k":"n","text":"1","sc":7,"line":245,"role":"effet affection"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:n0kydx14","k":"n","text":"1","sc":7,"line":245,"role":"effet trust"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:n05beknm","k":"n","text":"1","sc":7,"line":245,"role":"effet desire"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:n0cp53mm.1","k":"n","text":"2","sc":7,"line":245,"role":"effet affection"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:n0kydx14.1","k":"n","text":"1","sc":7,"line":245,"role":"effet trust"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:n0kydx14.2","k":"n","text":"1","sc":7,"line":246,"role":"effet trust"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:n05beknm.1","k":"n","text":"1","sc":7,"line":246,"role":"effet desire"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:n0cz4pbl","k":"n","text":"3","sc":7,"line":246,"role":"effet affection"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:n0lscq41","k":"n","text":"2","sc":7,"line":246,"role":"effet trust"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s0xfdc0u","k":"s","text":"Vous ramassez vos affaires et sortez sans bruit. Derrière vous, aucune des deux ne s’interrompt pour vous retenir. Vous vous asseyez sur la banquette du couloir.","sc":8,"line":269},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s0smf669","k":"s","text":"Les voix continuent longtemps. Celle de Naïah monte, se brise, remonte, et vous vous surprenez à croire qu’il se passe vraiment quelque chose de neuf derrière ce velours.","sc":8,"line":270},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s1mwqup0","k":"s","text":"Puis la porte s’ouvre d’un coup. Bellirith, un drap de soie serré contre elle, crie vers l’intérieur de la chambre.","sc":8,"line":271},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s0dg4j58","k":"s","text":"Mais tu ne ressens toujours rien !","sc":8,"line":272},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s160czwz","k":"s","text":"Tu t’amuses, tu triomphes, tu rayonnes d’orgueil ! Et de ce que je cherchais, rien. Rien depuis la première bougie !","sc":8,"line":273},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s04enkmu","k":"s","text":"De la chambre jaillit un éclat de rire si énorme qu’il en devient presque un cri. Naïah apparaît sur le seuil, la cape de Bellirith sur les épaules, les yeux pleins de larmes de joie.","sc":8,"line":274},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s176g57t","k":"s","text":"Tout ! Tout était faux ! Et tu es allée jusqu’au bout quand même !","sc":8,"line":275},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s07f3wmp","k":"s","text":"Parce que tu me l’as demandé, peste !","sc":8,"line":276},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s02i3ibu","k":"s","text":"Je sais ! C’était ça, le pari !","sc":8,"line":277},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s0t4pchq","k":"s","text":"Bellirith vous aperçoit enfin sur votre banquette. Elle vous dévisage avec la colère d’une reine trahie par son propre public.","sc":8,"line":278},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s1tasim1","k":"s","text":"Et toi, tu y as cru. Je le sens d’ici, ne prends pas cet air-là.","sc":8,"line":279},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s1k3o8h1.1","k":"s","text":"Même là ?","sc":9,"line":282,"role":"title"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s09rlmam","k":"s","text":"Avouer que vous y avez cru.","sc":9,"line":284,"role":"text"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s1k26pf7","k":"s","text":"J’y ai cru.","sc":9,"line":285,"sp":"{player}","role":"text"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s02laioe","k":"s","text":"Mon public y a cru ! Je veux une statue.","sc":9,"line":286,"role":"response"},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:s1aiauw3","k":"s","text":"Tu auras un cachot.","sc":9,"line":287,"role":"response"}],"arrays":[{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:a0f9inpm","path":"BN_OBJECTIVES","kind":"paras","len":7,"sc":1,"line":26,"top":true,"els":[[27,27],[28,28],[29,29],[30,30],[31,31],[32,32],[33,33]]},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:a1q4tgqb","path":"cross-bn-05-door.choices","kind":"items","len":1,"sc":9,"line":284,"els":[[284,288]]},{"id":"bellirith-naiah-cross-quest:a0wb62ph","path":"cross-bn-05-door-own.response","kind":"items","len":3,"sc":9,"line":284,"els":[[285,285],[286,286],[287,287]]}]}